        "zh": "一位來自中國的陌生人用中文說你好。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An American boy and his nephew see a bear and a lion.",
        "zh": "一位美國男孩和他的姪子看到一隻熊和一隻獅子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They also spot a bird, a bee, and a monkey near the tree.",
        "zh": "他們也在樹旁看到一隻鳥、一隻蜜蜂和一隻猴子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A snake slides past a tiger while a foreigner watches.",
        "zh": "一條蛇滑過一隻老虎，而一位外國人在觀看。"
      },
      {
        "en": "All the animals feel happy because someone shares food.",
        "zh": "所有動物都感到開心，因為有人分享食物。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "grammar_points": [
    {
      "title_zh": "① some-/any-/every-/no- 字頭的用法",
      "explain_zh": "說明someone, anyone, everyone, nobody 在不同句型中的使用：肯定句用 some-，疑問句用 any-，全體句用 every-，否定句用 no-。",
      "table": [
        [
          "句型",
          "some-",
          "any-",
          "every-",
          "no-"
        ],
        [
          "肯定句",
          "Someone is here.",
          "",
          "Everyone is happy.",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "疑問句",
          "",
          "Is anyone at home?",
          "",
          ""
        ],
        [
          "否定句",
          "",
          "",
          "",
          "Nobody knows the answer."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "title_zh": "② 不定代名詞當主詞時動詞用單數",
      "explain_zh": "不定代名詞如 someone, anyone, everyone, nobody 視為單數，因此動詞要用單數形式（加 -s 或用 is/has 等）。",
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "Someone likes the new book.",
          "zh": "有人喜歡這本新書。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Everyone needs a friend.",
          "zh": "每個人都需要朋友。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Nobody wants to be late.",
          "zh": "沒有人想遲到。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Anyone can join the game.",
          "zh": "任何人都可以參加遊戲。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "dialogue": {
